# Real values are set per-environment in Vercel (Preview vs Production scopes) — NOT committed here.
# This file just documents the variables the app expects.

# Browser-exposed config must be prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME=Vita

# --- Supabase (server-only) ---
# Project URL from the Supabase dashboard → Project Settings → API → "Project URL".
# Paste either the bare origin or the REST endpoint; lib/supabase.ts normalises it.
# SUPABASE_URL=
# Same screen → "service_role" secret. NEVER expose this to the browser.
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# --- Claude (server-only, slice 2: photo → calorie estimation) ---
# From console.anthropic.com → API keys. This is pay-as-you-go and billed
# separately from any Claude subscription. The photo itself is never persisted —
# it goes to the API in-memory and is discarded after estimation.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
